  "story": {
    "title": "ADVENTURES WITH AMMA and ARJUN",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "AMMA AND I DECIDED TO CYCLE TO CHIKKAJALA WHICH IS QUITE FAR AWAY FROM OUR HOUSE. IT WAS GOING TO BE A GREAT ADVENTURE. THE SLOPE WAS DOWNHILL AND SO WE ZOOOOOMED DOWN. WHAT FUN! WHEN IT WAS UPHILL, IT WAS HARD. THERE WERE BIG VEHICLES LIKE TRUCKS AND THERE WERE ANIMALS LIKE GOATS ON THE WAY. YOO HOO! THIS IS FUN",
      "THEN WE TURNED RIGHT AND THERE WAS NO ONE ON THE ROAD. WE CROSSED A BEAUTIFUL LAKE. WE SAW AN ABANDONED TEMPLE WITH HUGE STATUES OF HANUMAN AND LAKSHMI. WE TOOK PHOTOS IN FRONT OF THE STATUE. SUDDENLY WE REALISED WE WERE LOST. OUR GPS WAS NOT WORKING. WE WERE SCARED.",
      "AMMA SAID WE SHOULD GO BACK IN THE ROAD WE CAME IN. BUT THAT WAS A LONG WAY OFF AND WE DIDNT HAVE ENOUGH WATER TO LAST US. THEN SUDDENLY I SAW A FAMILIAR EAGLE CIRCLING THE SKY, NOT VERY FAR FROM WHERE WE STOOD WITH OUR CYCLES. I POINTED TO THE EAGLE AND TOLD AMMA THAT OUR HOUSE WAS IN THAT DIRECTION BECAUSE THE EAGLE'S NEST IS IN THE COCONUT TREE NEXT TO OUR HOUSE.",
      "SO WE TOOK A MUD ROAD THAT WAS VERY BUMPY. MY CYCLE GOT STUCK IN A HUGE POT HOLE. WE SOMEHOW GOT IT OUT AND RODE OVER A BUND ON THE LAKE FOR A WHILE TILL I SPOTTED PRASHASTI'S HOUSE, A HOUSE IN OUR LAYOUT. YAY! WE WERE SO HAPPY THAT WE WERE IN FAMILIAR SURROUNDINGS. BUT THERE WAS ANOTHER PROBLEM....",
      "THERE WAS NO ENTRANCE IN THAT PART OF OUR LAYOUT. THE GATE WAS ON THE OTHER SIDE. WE WERE CLOSE TO A HUGE COMPOUND WALL. WE THREW OUR CYCLES OVER THE COMPOUND WALL AND JUMPED DOWN LIKE MONKEYS. WHAT A CRAZY ADVENTURE! THE END."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "AMMA AND I DECIDED TO CYCLE TO CHIKKAJALA WHICH IS QUITE FAR AWAY FROM OUR HOUSE.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Amma và tôi rủ nhau đạp xe đi Chikkajala. Chỗ đó xa nhà lắm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "IT WAS GOING TO BE A GREAT ADVENTURE.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đó sẽ là một cuộc phiêu lưu tuyệt vời."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "THE SLOPE WAS DOWNHILL AND SO WE ZOOOOOMED DOWN.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đoạn dốc đi xuống nên chúng tôi phóng vèo vèo."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "WHAT FUN! WHEN IT WAS UPHILL, IT WAS HARD.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vui quá! Khi lên dốc thì khó lắm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "THERE WERE BIG VEHICLES LIKE TRUCKS AND THERE WERE ANIMALS LIKE GOATS ON THE WAY.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trên đường có nhiều xe lớn như xe tải và có cả các con vật như dê nữa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "YOO HOO! THIS IS FUN",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Yoo hoo! Vui thật!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "THEN WE TURNED RIGHT AND THERE WAS NO ONE ON THE ROAD.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau đó chúng tôi rẽ phải và không thấy ai trên đường cả."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "WE CROSSED A BEAUTIFUL LAKE.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tôi đi qua một cái hồ rất đẹp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "WE SAW AN ABANDONED TEMPLE WITH HUGE STATUES OF HANUMAN AND LAKSHMI.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tôi thấy một ngôi đền bỏ hoang với những bức tượng khổng lồ của Hanuman và Lakshmi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "WE TOOK PHOTOS IN FRONT OF THE STATUE.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tôi chụp ảnh trước bức tượng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "SUDDENLY WE REALISED WE WERE LOST.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bỗng nhiên chúng tôi nhận ra mình đã bị lạc."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "OUR GPS WAS NOT WORKING.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "GPS của chúng tôi không hoạt động."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "WE WERE SCARED.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tôi sợ hãi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "AMMA SAID WE SHOULD GO BACK IN THE ROAD WE CAME IN.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Amma nói chúng tôi nên quay lại con đường cũ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "BUT THAT WAS A LONG WAY OFF AND WE DIDNT HAVE ENOUGH WATER TO LAST US.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng đường đó xa lắm và chúng tôi không đủ nước uống."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "THEN SUDDENLY I SAW A FAMILIAR EAGLE CIRCLING THE SKY, NOT VERY FAR FROM WHERE WE STOOD WITH OUR CYCLES.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Rồi bỗng nhiên tôi thấy một con đại bàng quen thuộc đang bay lượn trên trời, không xa chỗ chúng tôi đang đứng cùng xe đạp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I POINTED TO THE EAGLE AND TOLD AMMA THAT OUR HOUSE WAS IN THAT DIRECTION BECAUSE THE EAGLE'S NEST IS IN THE COCONUT TREE NEXT TO OUR HOUSE.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tôi chỉ vào con đại bàng và nói với Amma rằng nhà chúng tôi ở hướng đó, vì tổ của đại bàng nằm trên cây dừa cạnh nhà mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "SO WE TOOK A MUD ROAD THAT WAS VERY BUMPY.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Thế là chúng tôi đi vào một con đường đất rất gồ ghề."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "MY CYCLE GOT STUCK IN A HUGE POT HOLE.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Xe đạp của tôi bị kẹt vào một cái ổ gà lớn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "WE SOMEHOW GOT IT OUT AND RODE OVER A BUND ON THE LAKE FOR A WHILE TILL I SPOTTED PRASHASTI'S HOUSE, A HOUSE IN OUR LAYOUT.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tôi tìm cách lấy xe ra và đi dọc theo bờ hồ một lúc cho đến khi tôi thấy nhà Prashasti, một ngôi nhà trong khu của chúng tôi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "YAY! WE WERE SO HAPPY THAT WE WERE IN FAMILIAR SURROUNDINGS.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hoan hô! Chúng tôi rất vui vì đã ở trong một nơi quen thuộc."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "BUT THERE WAS ANOTHER PROBLEM....",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng lại có một vấn đề khác...."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "THERE WAS NO ENTRANCE IN THAT PART OF OUR LAYOUT.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Không có lối vào ở phía đó của khu nhà chúng tôi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "THE GATE WAS ON THE OTHER SIDE.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cổng thì ở phía bên kia."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "WE WERE CLOSE TO A HUGE COMPOUND WALL.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_024.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tôi ở gần một bức tường rào lớn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "WE THREW OUR CYCLES OVER THE COMPOUND WALL AND JUMPED DOWN LIKE MONKEYS.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_025.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tôi ném xe đạp qua bức tường rào và nhảy xuống như những con khỉ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "WHAT A CRAZY ADVENTURE! THE END.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_133490/s_026.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Thật là một cuộc phiêu lưu điên rồ! Hết truyện."
      }
    ]
  },
